OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant to appeal after alcohol
OL,4,Alicence revoked
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn East Sussex restaurant which
OL,7,Fexperienced a gas leak where 16 people
OL,8,Fwere treated for suspected carbon
OL,9,Fmonoxide poisoning has had its alcohol
OL,10,Flicence revoked following a review.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, Hastings Borough Council
OL,13,F(HBC) assessed a review application for
OL,14,Fthe Grand Pera restaurant in Harold
OL,15,FPlace, Hastings, amid concerns over a
OL,16,Flack of "confidence" in the owner's
OL,17,Fability to manage the premises.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
