OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant to appeal after alcohol
OL,4,Alicence revoked
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,7,FReporting Service, the licensing
OL,8,Fcommittee also amended the restaurant's
OL,9,Fpremises licence, removing its ability
OL,10,Fto sell hot food after 23:00 BST.
OL,12,FMustafa Ergun, licence holder for Grand
OL,13,FPera, told the BBC that he intends to
OL,14,Fappeal the decision.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
